EventScript_ResetAllBerries::
	@ Ichor: Emerald planted berries in its Hoenn route trees here. Those trees are
	@ gone with the maps (hoenn-cut batch 2); Aethos's trees set their own state.
	@ Ichor: world-act3, the Neraida falls' terraces (Krenaia's first fruits)
	setberrytree BERRY_TREE_ICHOR_NERAIDA_LUM, BERRY_ID_LUM, BERRY_STAGE_BERRIES
	setberrytree BERRY_TREE_ICHOR_NERAIDA_SITRUS, BERRY_ID_SITRUS, BERRY_STAGE_BERRIES
	return

